Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tsubasa-kun, harika bir kontrolle\Ntopu tam istediği yere gönderiyor!{\i0} {Tsubasa shots the ball to the place where you exactly want the ball to be, with a perfect control!} {you SHOOT the ball, you take a SHOT. when something is named, it is a SHOT. Falcon SHOT, Fire SHOT, Drive SHOT—regardless of whether they say FAIYA SHOTTO or DURAIVU SHUUTO, they are always SHOTs. but when you are taking the action, the verb is TO SHOOT. in this case, Tsubasa SHOOTS, because he used the verb.}
